{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L17939604317550", "bug_category": "harness_meta", "symptom": "多次 edit_file 解析失败，最终 run_tests 报 6 failed,2 passed，test_last_le_middle 断言失败。", "root_cause": "edit_file 的 path 参数后标签被截断（如 </para），修改未落盘，src/search.py 的 last_le 仍返回错误下标。", "fix_pattern": "解析失败时先 read_file 读 src/search.py，确认 last_le，再用完整闭合的 edit_file 重发修改；修后 run_tests 并补空数组/全大于/重复值用例。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库；工具调用 XML/JSON 必须完整闭合，tests/ 只读。", "family": "boundary+cache_state", "source_task": "multi-boundary-last_le-x-cache_state-square_cache_key", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["last_le"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T02:20:31", "status": "active", "injections": 0, "success_after": 0, "fail_after": 0, "dedup_hits": 0}}
{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L17939612309231", "bug_category": "parsing_robustness", "symptom": "隐藏测试在 split_path 的 '..' 或非字符串边界断言失败，最终 1 failed, 7 passed。", "root_cause": "src/parsing.py 的 split_path 只过滤空串和 '.'，未按隐藏约定处理 '..'，且 finish 前未通读 src/ 其他模块。", "fix_pattern": "split_path 分隔后过滤 { '', '.', '..' } 并明确非 str 行为；finish 前用自测覆盖 src/ 全部函数。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库，tests/ 只读不能修改。", "family": "mutable_default+parsing", "source_task": "multi-mutable_default-merge_defaults-x-parsing-split_path", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["split_path"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T02:33:50", "status": "active", "injections": 0, "success_after": 0, "fail_after": 0, "dedup_hits": 0}}
