{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L17939614755992", "bug_category": "cache_state", "symptom": "可见 tests 全部通过后，隐藏用例仍然失败；Counter.reset() 返回 0，而不是计数器对象，导致链式调用或对返回值类型的断言报错。", "root_cause": "src/state.py 中的 Counter.reset 只把 self.total 清零并 return self.total，擅自改变了原本 return self 的接口契约。", "fix_pattern": "修复 reset 这类状态方法时保留原返回契约：self.total=0 后 return self，并补充 c.reset() is c、连续 add/reset 的用例。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库，tests/ 只读", "family": "types+cache_state", "source_task": "multi-types-compare_values-x-cache_state-counter_reset", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["Counter", "add", "reset"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T02:37:55", "status": "active", "injections": 0, "success_after": 0, "fail_after": 0, "dedup_hits": 0}}
