{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L17939616132423", "bug_category": "boundary_compare", "symptom": "run_tests tests 仅 2 passed；finish 后最终判定 2 failed, 6 passed，可见测试未暴露 first_nonnegative 的无匹配边界。", "root_cause": "src/search.py 的 first_nonnegative 修掉 arr[:-1] 漏检末元素后，又把无匹配返回值从 len(arr) 改成 -1，误判原契约的插入边界语义。", "fix_pattern": "对 first_nonnegative 先确认无匹配返回 len(arr) 还是 -1；只把 arr[:-1] 改为 arr，并用空列表、全负数、末位非负的 run_python 断言验证。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库；tests/ 只读，不能改测试。", "family": "boundary+mutable_default", "source_task": "multi-boundary-first_nonnegative-x-mutable_default-Stack", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["first_nonnegative"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T02:40:13", "status": "active", "injections": 0, "success_after": 0, "fail_after": 0, "dedup_hits": 0}}
