{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L17939616766014", "bug_category": "recursion_base", "symptom": "可见的 9 条测试只关乎 paging.py，最终是 1 failed，隐藏用例的 to_binary(0) 期望 '0' 却得到空串；负数输入无限递归导致 RecursionError；src/recursion.py 始终没有被改动。", "root_cause": "src/recursion.py 的 to_binary 把 n==0 当作返回空串的终止情况，且没有针对 n<0 的守卫；另外，step 10–12 写给 recursion.py 的 write_file 调用因工具标记损坏而被解析失败，补丁从未写入磁盘，agent 也没有回读确认。", "fix_pattern": "对 to_binary 只修改基例：n==0 时 return '0'，n<0 时 raise ValueError；用 edit_file 小步修改，然后用 python -c \"from src.recursion import to_binary; print(to_binary(0),to_binary(6))\" 验证，再运行 pytest tests/，最后 finish。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库，tests/ 只读，不得修改测试。", "family": "paging+recursion", "source_task": "multi-paging-between_inclusive-x-recursion-to_binary", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["to_binary"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T02:41:16", "status": "active", "injections": 0, "success_after": 0, "fail_after": 0, "dedup_hits": 0}}
