{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L17939639681436", "bug_category": "type_conversion", "symptom": "pytest 最终 6 failed, 2 passed；隐藏用例覆盖 src/normalize.py 时 sort_ids 对数字字符串/混合类型 ID 排序错误。", "root_cause": "src/normalize.py::sort_ids 直接用原始值或字符串排序，未统一转 int，导致 '10' 排在 '2' 前。", "fix_pattern": "在 sort_ids 中用 key=lambda x:int(str(x).strip())，并自测空列表、单元素、'2'/'10'、混合 int/str 边界。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库；tests/ 只读，不能修改测试。", "family": "reduce_init+types", "source_task": "multi-reduce_init-clamp-x-types-sort_ids", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["sort_ids"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T03:19:28", "status": "active", "injections": 0, "success_after": 0, "fail_after": 0, "dedup_hits": 0}}
