{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L17939640434247", "bug_category": "parsing_robustness", "symptom": "可见 run_tests tests 通过，但最终隐藏测试 3 failed, 4 passed，失败集中在 src/parsing.py 的边界输入。", "root_cause": "parse_flags 未过滤 token=='--' 及 '--=v' 产生的空 key，token[2:].partition('=') 后把空字符串键写入 out，非法 token 被当成有效参数。", "fix_pattern": "在 parse_flags 中先跳过 '--'，对 token[2:] 用 partition('=')；key 为空则 continue；'--a=b=c' 保留 value='b=c'，None/非字符串继续跳过。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库，tests/ 只读，可自测时 sys.path.insert(0,'src')。", "family": "mutable_default+parsing", "source_task": "multi-mutable_default-collect_pairs-x-parsing-parse_flags", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["parse_flags"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T03:20:43", "status": "active", "injections": 0, "success_after": 0, "fail_after": 0, "dedup_hits": 0}}
