{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L17939643078188", "bug_category": "harness_meta", "symptom": "最终 2 failed：tests/test_visible.py 的 parse_csv_line 引号用例仍失败，flatten 空列表用例也失败，因为两次 write_file 内容过长被截断（step 8/9/12 解析失败），src/parsing.py 只写到一半就报语法错误，src/recursion.py 根本没被重写。", "root_cause": "单次 write_file 想把 parse_csv_line 全部引号/转义逻辑和迭代版 flatten 一次写进一个调用，输出被截断导致 JSON 解析失败；step 10 只重写了 parsing.py 且行为仍未通过可见用例，flatten 因 `and it` 保留空列表的缺陷始终未修。", "fix_pattern": "分模块小步写：先 write_file 只重写 src/recursion.py 的 flatten（去掉 `and it`，用显式栈迭代），再单独重写 src/parsing.py 的 parse_csv_line，每次写完 read_file 校验行数与结尾，最后跑 python -m pytest tests/。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库，不可改 tests/。", "family": "parsing+recursion", "source_task": "multi-parsing-parse_csv_line-x-recursion-flatten", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["flatten", "parse_csv_line"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T03:25:07", "status": "active", "injections": 0, "success_after": 0, "fail_after": 0, "dedup_hits": 0}}
