{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L17939612309231", "bug_category": "parsing_robustness", "symptom": "隐藏测试在 split_path 的 '..' 或非字符串边界断言失败，最终 1 failed, 7 passed。", "root_cause": "src/parsing.py 的 split_path 只过滤空串和 '.'，未按隐藏约定处理 '..'，且 finish 前未通读 src/ 其他模块。", "fix_pattern": "用 path.split('/') 后保留段与 {'','.','..'} 取差集，并显式处理开头 '/' 产生的空首段；改完分别对 'a/./b'、'../a'、'/a//b/' 构造断言，不能只靠 run_tests 的 2 passed 判定完成。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库，tests/ 只读不能修改。", "family": "mutable_default+parsing", "source_task": "multi-mutable_default-merge_defaults-x-parsing-split_path", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["split_path"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T02:33:50", "status": "active", "injections": 62, "success_after": 48, "fail_after": 14, "dedup_hits": 1}, "merged": true}
