{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L179396586304613", "bug_category": "boundary_compare", "symptom": "自测中 paginate_pairs 对 len(items)=7,size=3 输出末页 (4,[6]) 看似正常，但 finish 后隐藏测试 1 failed，实际仍漏掉尾块/页号错误（如 len 恰为 size 倍数或 size>len 的用例）。", "root_cause": "src/paging.py 的 while 条件写成 start < len(items) - size，用减法比较代替 start < len(items)，边界偏移一页，导致末尾不足一页的块与恰好整除的情形被漏算。", "fix_pattern": "改为 `start = 0; while start < len(items): out.append((start // size + 1, items[start:start+size])); start += size`，并自测 len=0、len<size、len%size==0、size>len 四种输入。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库，函数签名不变", "family": "mutable_default+paging", "source_task": "multi-mutable_default-add_metric-x-paging-paginate_pairs", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["paginate_pairs"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T03:51:03", "status": "active", "injections": 0, "success_after": 0, "fail_after": 0, "dedup_hits": 0}}
