{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L179396517847211", "bug_category": "parsing_robustness", "symptom": "可见 tests 2 passed，但最终隐藏测试 1 failed/6 passed，失败集中在 src/parsing.py 的 parse_range 对含空格或空项等边界规格处理不正确。", "root_cause": "src/parsing.py 的 parse_range 使用 _RANGE_RE=r'^(-?\\d+)-(-?\\d+)$'，且逗号分隔后未先 strip，导致 '1 - 3'、'1, 2' 等无法匹配或被误判。", "fix_pattern": "在 parse_range 中先 spec.strip()，按逗号 split 后逐项 strip，正则改为 ^\\s*(-?\\d+)\\s*-\\s*(-?\\d+)\\s*$，并补空格/负数/倒序/空项断言后用 run_tests 验证。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库（re）；tests/ 只读，不能修改。", "family": "cache_state+parsing", "source_task": "multi-cache_state-counter_reset-x-parsing-parse_range", "source_cycle": 0, "policy": "write_fail", "scope": ["parse_range"], "created_at": "2026-11-06T03:39:38", "status": "active", "injections": 10, "success_after": 7, "fail_after": 3, "dedup_hits": 1}, "merged": true}
